Earned_Calendar_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when to is at or before from
│   └── it should return 0
└── when to is after from
    ├── when the period is MONTH
    │   └── it should return rate times 12 times the clock difference
    ├── when the period is WEEK or YEAR
    │   └── it should return rate times the clock difference
    ├── when the period is not WEEK or MONTH or YEAR
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidPeriod
    ├── given from and to span exactly one whole calendar month
    │   └── it should return one month's amount times SCALE whatever the month's length
    ├── given from and to span exactly twelve whole calendar months
    │   └── it should return a yearly rate times SCALE exactly
    └── when the product overflows
        └── it should revert with the checked arithmetic panic
